<body>

<div style="text-align:center;margin:24px 0"><img src="../_svg/basic_addition.svg" alt="" style="max-width:95%;height:auto;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)"></div>

<div class="lf-page">
<div class="lf-cover">
<div class="lf-cover-logo">LF Academy · LF Academy</div>
<div class="lf-cover-grade">小四 · 第 33 堂 · Student Edition Handout</div>
<div class="lf-cover-title">四則混合運算進階</div>
<div class="lf-cover-subtitle">括號優先 · 括號前減號Trap · 65 min</div>
<div class="lf-cover-info">
<b>Textbook Reference：</b>《小學數學新思維（第二版）》4下A冊 單元六<br/>
<b>核心Trap：</b>🪤 <b>致命Trap：括號前係減號 → 裡面全部變號！</b><br/>
<b>SSPA 關聯：</b><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 高頻</span> 呈分試計算基礎，P5-P6延伸至Equation<br/>
<b>Prerequisites：</b>整數四則（+-×÷）· 括號優先概念<br/>
<b>Lesson Objectives：</b>❶ 掌握四則運算次序 ❷ 括號的優先級 ❸ 去括號變號規則 ❹ 多步混合運算
  </div>
<div class="lf-cover-row">
<span>Student Name：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Class：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Date：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Duration：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">一、Warm-Up （5 min）（共 5 題，5 min）</div>

<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">🏆 陷阱獵人·計時挑戰</div><div class="lf-game-desc">每題限時90秒！搵出隱藏嘅陷阱，答對+1分，連續答對分數加倍！</div><div class="lf-game-action">⭐ 開始挑戰 →</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>3 + 5 × 2 = ？先做Multiplication定係Addition？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:38px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td>(3 + 5) × 2 = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:38px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>12 - 5 + 3 = ？由左至右計。</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>20 - (8 + 3) = ？（括號內先計）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>20 - (8 - 3) = ？同上一題有咩分別？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">二、Core Knowledge （15 min） ＋ Worked Examples</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：四則運算次序 — 「先乘除、後加減」 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① <b>基本規則：</b>先乘除 → 後加減。如果有括號 → 括號最優先<br/>
      ② <b>同級（+/- 或 ×/÷）：</b>由左至右逐個計<br/>
      ③ <b>例：</b>5 + 3 × 4 = 5 + 12 = 17（NOT 8×4=32！）<br/>
      ④ <b>例：</b>20 ÷ 4 × 2 = 5 × 2 = 10（由左至右，NOT 20÷8！）
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例1</div><div class="lf-ex-q">8 + 12 ÷ 4 × 3 = ？</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例2</div><div class="lf-ex-q">(15 - 7) × (8 + 2) = ？</div></div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：括號的威力 — 改變運算次序 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA 必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① <b>括號內的先計：</b>無論括號外面係加減定乘除，括號永遠優先<br/>
      ② <b>多層括號：</b>( ) 最內 → [ ] 中層 → 最外層<br/>
      ③ <b>括號內都要跟乘除優先：</b>(2 + 3 × 4) = (2 + 12) = 14<br/>
      ④ <b>重點：</b>加括號同唔加括號，答案可以完全唔同！
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例3</div><div class="lf-ex-q">比較：(a) 6 + 2 × 5 = ？(b) (6 + 2) × 5 = ？</div></div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="big-warn">
<div class="bw-title">🪤 世紀Trap：括號前係減號 → 裡面全部變號！</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;">
<span style="color:var(--red);font-weight:900;">❌ 錯：</span>20 - (8 + 3) = 20 - 8 + 3 = 15（❌❌❌ 70% 學生咁錯！）<br/>
<span style="color:var(--green);font-weight:900;">✅ 對：</span>20 - (8 + 3) = 20 - 11 = 9（先計括號內！）<br/>
<br/>
<b>如果一定要去括號：</b>20 - (8 + 3) = 20 - 8 <b>-</b> 3 = 9<br/>
<b>規則：括號前係減號，去括號時裡面嘅 + 變 -，- 變 +</b><br/>
      例：15 - (10 - 3) = 15 - 7 = 8。或：15 - 10 + 3 = 8
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：去括號變號規則 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA 必考！</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① <b>括號前係 "+"：</b>直接去括號，裡面符號不變<br/>
        a + (b + c) = a + b + c<br/>
        a + (b - c) = a + b - c<br/>
      ② <b>括號前係 "-"：</b>去括號時，裡面<b>每個符號都要變</b>！<br/>
        a - (b + c) = a - b <b>-</b> c（+ 變 -）<br/>
        a - (b - c) = a - b <b>+</b> c（- 變 +）<br/>
      ③ <b>P4 安全做法：</b>先計括號內的數字，再用外面嘅運算符號！
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例4</div><div class="lf-ex-q">25 - (12 + 5) = ？兩種方法：(A)先計括號內 (B)去括號變號</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例5</div><div class="lf-ex-q">30 - (15 - 8) + (7 + 3) = ？</div></div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點四：含乘除的混合運算 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🟡 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① (a + b) × c ≠ a × c + b（❌ Common Mistake！）→ (a + b) × c = a×c + b×c<br/>
      ② <b>分配律：</b>這是 P5 內容，P4 只需計括號內先<br/>
      ③ <b>含乘除的變號：</b>只影響加減號，乘除號不變<br/>
        a - (b × c) = a - b×c（括號內先計）
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點一至四 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
